borderline (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add support hopcount match, and implement rfc4890
  * Apply nft optimizations
  * Use interface ids for faster packet handling, rather than matching on strings
  * Add option to select interface group.
  * Remove vlan matching in zone definition. Use interface groups instead
  * Add 'protocol = [ "s1", "s2" ]' to match l4 protocols (udp, tcp etc).
  * Improve rule optimization to remove redundant flags
  * Add classifier "ipv4|ipv6" to match only on ipv4 or ipv6

